// Package proto holds the Protobuf definitions of the Tanvo API and the
// code generated from them. The sources are in tanvo/<domain>/v1; the Go
// packages are in gen/go/tanvo/<domain>/v1 (messages with the Opaque API
// and Connect handlers), the TypeScript modules in gen/ts and the OpenAPI
// document in gen/openapi. Regenerate with `pnpm nx run proto:generate`.
package proto
